    "title": "Yes, you can get a DUI on an e-bike. Bodycam shows Winter Springs traffic stop - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago WINTER SPRINGS, Fla. – A man is facing a DUI charge after officers in Winter Springs say they watched him fall backward off an e-bike this week. News 6 obtained body camera video of the traffic stop near State Road 434 around 3 a.m. Monday. It shows the man sitting on the e-bike as officers ask him questions about the night. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
